{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmebtzeNznDnZoEY9HCT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've read six of the seven screens and I'm stopping there because I'm tired. Here is my account.\n\n**What I'd tell my son:** \"Listen, I found where it is, but I didn't get my answer. On the first screen there's a box called **'להבין סוג של חיסכון'**, 'מה זה, כמה זה עולה ואיך זה ממוסה', which is exactly what I wanted. It led to a page called **'מדריך'** with a card **'פיקדון'** and a card **'תכנית חיסכון'**. But I only saw their titles. The page moved on before I read what they say, and after that it was all shares and English letters. Next time I'll click 'תכנית חיסכון' right away. Or you'll come over and do it with me. I'm not very sure about any of it.\"\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n1. **The home page.** The name \"מקור\" means nothing to me; it's not a bank. Then \"להבין חיסכון והשקעה בישראל\" and \"אתר אישי, לא מסחרי, בלי קישורי שיווק\", which calmed me a little. I saw a button \"פיקדון שמסתיים\", which is my situation. There's a form with boxes \"יש לכם היום ₪\", \"ובכל חודש ₪\" and \"שנים\", and I didn't fill it in. On the left was the box \"להבין סוג של חיסכון\", the one I came for.\n2. **Further down the home page.** There were questions: \"כמה מס משלמים על ריבית מפיקדון?\" I'd like to know that, but I didn't open it.\n3. **The \"מדריך\" page.** It says every saving has two parts: \"איפה הכסף מוחזק\" and \"במה הכסף מושקע\". That was a bit too much. Under \"כסף שוטף וקצר\" I saw the cards \"חשבון עובר ושב\", \"פיקדון\" and \"תכנית חיסכון\", but only their titles. On the next screen only the ends of the sentences showed (\"ריבית\", \"מוסכמת בריבית\").\n4. **Then:** קרן כספית, מק\"מ, קרן השתלמות, pension funds, \"חיסכון לכל ילד\" (that one's for the grandchildren, worth asking about), \"איגרות חוב ממשלתיות\", and then \"מדד S&P 500\", \"MSCI World\", \"נאסד\"ק\". By then I felt it wasn't for me anymore.\n\n**What I skipped:** the form with the amounts, the questions, \"לכל השדות\", \"מה האתר עוד לא מכסה\", the bottom line of links, and the seventh screen.\n\n**Words I didn't understand:** מקור (as a name), קרן כספית, קרן כספית מתחדשת, מק\"מ, \"מדד\" (here it isn't the price index), S&P 500, MSCI World, MSCI AC World, נאסד\"ק, ת\"א-35/90/125, צמודה / לא צמודה, \"קופון\", \"מנוטרלת ממנו\", \"מסלול כללי\", קופת גמל להשקעה, ניהול אישי.\n\n**What bothered me**\n- The black background with small grey writing is hard to read even with my glasses on. The line \"בכל עמוד של מוצר יש שורה...\" was very faint, and so was \"אתר אישי, לא מסחרי\".\n- On the first screen I can't tell who's behind the site. It isn't a bank and doesn't look official, and \"לא מסחרי\" isn't enough for me.\n- The cards for פיקדון and תכנית חיסכון got cut off between screens, so I saw only the headings.\n- \"קרן כספית\" is put first under \"כסף שצריך להישאר זמין\", ahead of the deposit, which is what I actually know.\n- The bottom half is all indexes and English letters, which tires me and makes me anxious."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3831,"cache_read_input_tokens":11628,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3831},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f602fccd-58cf-4a03-a3da-af440121ebbd","uuid":"ba69fe63-b028-4e4d-928d-2c81b508490d","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:09:22.474Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmebtnjq2qLdrTKCxR1k"}
